      "narration_text": "So what is a seed good for? It's a control in an experiment: keep the seed, change one word, and you see exactly what that word did. But a seed can't carry a style or a character across different prompts, and it isn't reliable in Turbo mode. For a consistent look across assets, Midjourney recommends style references, moodboards, and personalization instead.",
